        <body>
            <div xml:id="d679">

                <pb facs="0832" n="738" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg738"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lee to Mr.
                            Rockhill</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate-General</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-08-19"><hi rendition="#italic">August 19,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 90.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my dispatch, No. 79, of
                    the 11th instant, in which I communicated to the Department the answer of the
                    Governor-General to the inquiry if funds subscribed in the United States to
                    ameliorate the condition of the American prisoners of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Competitor</hi>, in confinement at the Cabaña fortress,
                    might be forwarded them to provide them better food and accommodations, I have
                    now the honor to transmit a copy translation of another communication from
                    General Weyler, to the effect that the governor of the fort has been asked to
                    report on the condition of said prisoners; and with respect to their food, which
                    is the same as that supplied to all prisoners by the municipal authorities, they
                    might obtain it at their own expense and of better quality.</p>
                <p>I therefore infer from said communication that the friends of the prisoners will
                    be allowed to transmit them funds, either through this office, to be delivered
                    to them direct, or to purchase food to be sent them.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fitzhugh Lee.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d679-a1.xml" xpointer="d679-a1"/>
            </div>
